            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The direct responsibilities of administering an intramural program should be delegated to one person. This individual should be a certified physical education instructor. The intramural program is a direct outgrowth of the physical education program and is to conducted during the student day with the approval of the Intramural Council and worksite supervisor.",
