        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Act as a supervisor of the entire intramural program and staff; (2) Assign intramural day responsibilities to each subject content area for grade-level activities; (3) Serve as a member of the county middle school intramural council; (4) Serve as chairman of the school intramural advisory council; (5) Submit intramural activity reports and other required summaries as requested by the proper county authority; (6) Be responsible for all publicity; (7) Coordinate intramural program with physical education department; (8) Promote interest in the program through leadership, enthusiasm and guidance; (9) Formulate and administer necessary policies; (10) Provide for facilities in assigning or scheduling the activities program; (11) Keep accurate up-to-date records of participation and achievement of each individual team; (12) Submit requisitions and make purchases with principal's approval; (13) Establish and follow county policies relating to health, safety, and accidents; (14)",
